(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-40","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["池口的[[bronze|青铜]]环仍可用，季禾将工队独有的[[subculture|行规习惯]]讲给外村人听：料不确认，便不入槽。沈砚与村民[[pore|细读]]旧图，韩长老的[[eloquent|有说服力的]]说明要与尺数一起看。一块[[weird|古怪的]]圆石从池底滚出，原是旧[[artillery|火炮]]的座料，不是阵中神器。许庭很[[cynical|讥诮]]，说凡人研究不完。顾衡先认每一项[[constituent|组成的]]料，图上的[[aesthetic|悦目的]]线条不能替安全检查，边[[caption|说明文字]]也须写清是否亲测。新规在这件小事上就要花半天，却没有人替这半天的等待叫冤。","井边的[[hardy|耐寒的]]草移到岸外，外商捐布人信[[catholic|天主教]]，仍可同工队一起[[save|救护]]工棚外的老人。他们不是为了修池才[[transplant|移植]]病者，罗清只转移受施工震动影响的一排床。医馆的[[deficit|亏空]]由收费与捐项各列，生命虽[[sacred|神圣]]，费用不能因此变成无人负责。许庭的旧放贷客曾被叫[[shark|高利贷者]]，也得按实款核。旧记税人如[[historian|史料研究者]]般比对年份，顾峦在新[[overpass|过渠桥]]上递尺，痛得低声[[moan|呻吟]]也说今天只做半班，没硬撑留下更大伤。","工匠给底石的[[rating|评估等级]]是可用但有裂，判断很[[nasty|难办]]。山门代表[[yell|大喊]]修太慢，顾衡不[[mock|嘲笑]]他们怕失水，带他们看裂隙。两条临时槽能[[facilitate|便利]]过水，但必须有人值守。富户愿[[endow|资助]]一段桥，手却[[quiver|发抖]]，怕旧押款不能取回。沈砚请他按自己的能力承诺，不必捐尽。裂石中有[[quartz|石英]]脉，季禾按[[literal|字面的]]刻数重测，没有沿用上班人的猜值。门外[[gossip|流言]]说三家已经偷偷取回钥匙，两名守水人当面展示独立封签，谣言不再只靠回骂处理。","下游的[[slum|贫民居住处]]先试小流，钟楼[[pendulum|钟摆]]暂不摆到第三声。周伯持[[cane|手杖]]跟去，顾峦想[[snatch|抢着拿]]重尺，他劝别逞强。沈砚眼一[[blink|眨]]，试水[[momentum|冲力]]将槽板推斜；手上的[[sensation|感觉]]还不稳，无法独拧急闸。他喊停，两边普通守水人同收绳，把松动钉[[embed|嵌牢]]。许庭本想[[grin|咧嘴笑]]他仍像新人，看到下游孩童收起[[giggle|咯咯笑]]，也帮忙拖住箱，不再让货挡逃路。停闸不是丢脸，未停才会把第一次复测变成新灾。","暂缓的[[notification|通知]]挂上钟楼，工队用薄[[foil|金属片]]查槽缝。绳的[[tangle|缠结]]与半寸的错量都已解开，沈砚伤手的[[handicap|不利条件]]却需要长期分工。季禾重排模型，第二份[[esthetic|美观的]]设计图清楚标出每个普通人能做的动作。检验[[endurance|耐久性]]需过夜水位，不能看一遍就走。他们把每次拓图贴成[[album|拓片簿]]，拒用[[sensational|耸人听闻的]]喜报掩盖停水两刻。孤城那场[[plague|病灾]]仍需后续照护，外商旧[[colonial|殖民地的]]货票也只是运输单，不是让水永归商行的约。","第二轮试水终于稳住，两村与三家分别写下原始水位，城中回报还需一日才能到。顾衡愿让下一班复核自己的数，季禾不再替错量辩解。沈砚看见母亲旧田旁也开了一个普通出口，明白旧池改为缓冲池仍会使自家浇田慢一倍。他签下减量，别人随后才签。许庭抱怨运输期变长，要求加运费；双方约好只按实际多走的路核。夜里没有庆功钟，只按守水告示收取、清槽、放水。明日得到城里的真实回报后，第三声才会成为上下游都已听得懂的信号。"],"en":["Ji kept a [[bronze|bronze]] ring and explained his crew’s [[subculture|subculture]]: unverified material stayed out. Villagers would [[pore|pore]] over maps while Han’s [[eloquent|eloquent]] account faced measurements. A [[weird|weird]] stone was old [[artillery|artillery]] foundation, not magic. [[cynical|Cynical]] Xu complained. Gu identified each [[constituent|constituent]] material. [[aesthetic|Aesthetic]] lines and a [[caption|caption]] must distinguish measured from reported values. They accepted the half-day this verification required.","[[hardy|Hardy]] plants moved aside. A [[catholic|Catholic]] donor helped [[save|save]] an elder, without belief conditions. Luo did not [[transplant|transplant]] patients for convenience, only beds affected by vibration. Clinic [[deficit|deficit]] columns separated fees and donations. [[sacred|Sacred]] lives did not erase actual costs; a creditor called a [[shark|shark]] still faced calculation. A clerk acted as a [[historian|historian]]. On an [[overpass|overpass]], Luan gave a [[moan|moan]] and chose a half-shift instead of worsening injury.","The stone [[rating|rating]] was usable but cracked, a [[nasty|nasty]] decision. Delegates began to [[yell|yell]]. Gu would not [[mock|mock]] their fears and showed the gap. Temporary channels would [[facilitate|facilitate]] flow only with watchers. A donor offering to [[endow|endow]] a bridge began to [[quiver|quiver]]; Shen required an affordable promise. Ji inspected [[quartz|quartz]] seams under [[literal|literal]] marks. [[gossip|Gossip]] claimed keys had been reclaimed. Independent sealed custody answered it publicly.","The downstream [[slum|slum]] received a small trial. The bell [[pendulum|pendulum]] waited. Zhou’s [[cane|cane]] accompanied Luan, who tried to [[snatch|snatch]] a heavy ruler. In a [[blink|blink]], water [[momentum|momentum]] tilted a plank. Shen’s unreliable hand [[sensation|sensation]] prevented solitary closure. He called stop; ordinary keepers pulled together and would [[embed|embed]] loose fastenings. Xu’s prospective [[grin|grin]] faded when children ceased to [[giggle|giggle]]. He cleared cargo from the escape route. Stopping prevented another disaster.","A delay [[notification|notification]] went up. Thin [[foil|foil]] checked gaps; rope [[tangle|tangle]] and wrong dimensions were corrected. Shen’s [[handicap|handicap]] required lasting shared work. A second [[esthetic|esthetic]] diagram marked ordinary operators. [[endurance|Endurance]] testing needed overnight readings, recorded in an [[album|album]] of rubbings. No [[sensational|sensational]] announcement hid the brief stoppage. City [[plague|plague]] care continued; an old [[colonial|colonial]] cargo ticket remained a shipping document, not perpetual ownership.","The second trial held. Villages and sects signed raw readings and awaited city reports. Gu welcomed later checks. Shen’s own field now received water at half its former pace; he signed that reduction before asking others. Xu requested extra transport payment, limited to actual added distance. No triumph bell sounded that night. Only after the city’s reply tomorrow would the third stroke become a signal understood at both ends."]});
